iconlibutils (0.0.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Restructure CLI into iconlib.cmd/<command>.py (ZL001; README length
    exempt); fold pull schema and web index helpers into their commands.
  * Drop legacy library/<name>/library.conf directory discovery.
  * Remove scripts/ from the tree and rewrite history to purge them.
  * Use /usr/bin/python3 shebang on bindir wrappers so a venv env
    python3 cannot hide the system iconlib package.
  * Add local helpers: delete, rename, copy, ln, and make (-s/-F
    variants).
  * Replace findicon.py with findicon.sh; add meson-substituted
    iconlib.in bash launcher.
  * Document install-prefix paths (drop /usr/local from docs and
    defaults).
  * Split meson tests into iconlib, findicon, and faiss targets; print
    FAISS progress.
  * Refresh gettext catalogs for new CLI strings and local commands.
  * Prefer cairosvg over rsvg for SVG rasterization; depend on python3-
    cairosvg.
  * Meson-substitute package version and pkgdatadir/datadir/localedir
    into iconlib._config.
  * Keep WordNet/semantic search as the baseline when FAISS indexes are
    absent.
  * Defer inflect and search imports so iconlib -h starts quickly.
  * Point the bash launcher at Meson LOCALEDIR so rebuilt translations
    are visible before install.

 -- Lenik (谢继雷) <lenik@bodz.net>  Fri, 11 Sep 2026 22:16:26 +0800

iconlibutils (0.0.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Restructure sources into the iconlib Python package; stop installing
    helper modules to bindir.
  * Make findicon a shortcut for iconlib search; remove the iconlibutils
    bindir alias.
  * Extend iconlib index with -w/--web, -F/--faiss, -f/--force, -s/--
    upscale, default -o .
  * Add CLIP/FAISS indexer writing faiss.index, faiss.map, and
    faiss.json.
  * Require local CLIP model for FAISS index; print hfd download
    instructions when missing.
  * Query FAISS indexes during iconlib search when present for selected
    libraries.
  * Add bytesize-icons FAISS index/search integration test.
  * Discover libraries from drop-in files
    /usr/share/iconlibutils/library/<name> (not library.conf dirs).
  * Fix RPM %%files python sitelib path for noarch packaging.

 -- Lenik (谢继雷) <lenik@bodz.net>  Fri, 11 Sep 2026 21:45:00 +0800

iconlibutils (0.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rewrite iconlib as multi-command icon library CLI
    (search/which/info/pull/browse).
  * Add path registries, .iconlibrc project config, and auto library
    indexing.
  * Seed /etc/iconlibutils/path from known icon packages in postinst.
  * Enhance iconlib search with English inflection/synonyms via python3-
    pattern (WordNet), ranked by score.
  * Add schema tokens v/variant, m/stem, e/extension; default pull
    schema is n.
  * Fix gettext domain to iconlibutils; expand RPM %%files and mark
    noarch.
  * Rename commons.py to ilcommon.py; install localized man pages.
  * Add gettext and L1 man translations; Architecture all.
  * Raise meson unit-test timeout for Pattern/WordNet cold start under
    debuild.
  * Use offline wordnet-base + python3-inflect for search (avoid pattern
    hang in debuild).

 -- Lenik (谢继雷) <lenik@bodz.net>  Fri, 11 Sep 2026 17:21:59 +0800
